8,"Kaba Démé, Sara Language (KWG) – L1 & L2 Speakers, Status, Map, Endangered Level & Official Use | Ethnologue Free",https://www.ethnologue.com/language/kwg/,"Sara Kaba Démé is a stable indigenous language of Chad. It belongs to the Nilo-Saharan language family. Direct evidence is lacking, but the language is thought to be used as a first language by all in the ethnic community.","Kaba Démé, Sara",Nilo-Saharan
